{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15025","headline":"奉和太常王卿酬中书李舍人中书寓直春夜对月见寄 · 卢纶","name":"奉和太常王卿酬中书李舍人中书寓直春夜对月见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露如轻雨月如霜，不见星河见鴈行。\n虚晕入池波自泛，满轮当苑桂多香。\n春台几望黄龙阙，云路宁分白玉郎。\n是夜巴歌应金石，岂殊萤影对清光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15025.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15025","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}